  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "行銷研究與市場調查",
    "sub_ename": "MARKETING RESEARCH AND SURVEY",
    "describe_ch": "研討行銷管理之程序，主要包括：分析行銷環境、策略性行銷決策、戰術性行銷決策、行銷執行與控制等。其中策略性行銷及戰術性行銷，乃藉以瞭解所謂STP之市場區隔、選擇目標市場及定位，以及所謂4P's之產品、定價、通路及推廣等",
    "describe_eh": "This course include the integration of key marketing perspectives , emphasizing new thinking and approaches to marketing practice. This requires the ability to assess complex and changing marketing situation, to determine the best marketing strategies for these situations and to execute the strategies effectively. The course will be help students develop the understanding and skill to become successful marketers",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
